  "id": "dmw7kf0y6d2nn",
  "name": "滑块拖拽",
  "tags": [
    "拖拽",
    "交互"
  ],
  "summary": "拖动进度条末端的手柄连续调整数值；按住时手柄放大，数值实时跟随。",
  "usage": "连续数值的调节：视频/音频播放进度、音量、亮度、图片缩放比例；范围明确、需要即时反馈。",
  "caution": "离散选项（3–5 档）用单选或分段按钮更清楚；精度要求高（如 0.1 秒）要配输入框或微调键；移动端要加足够的触摸热区。",
  "hint": "按住手柄左右拖动调整数值",
  "prompt": "【滑块拖拽】目标：一条水平进度条，末端有圆形手柄；按住拖动连续调整数值。鼠标离滑条越远，同样的水平位移对应越小的数值变化，方便短滑条精细调。\n\n1) 结构：.slider（相对定位、高度 26px 作为热区）里放 .track + .fill + .knob；数值文字在标题行。\n\n2) **内部必须用浮点值**：`raw` 存浮点（0..100），`fill`/`knob` 的位置也用浮点百分比，只在显示文字时 `Math.round`。用整数累加会把每帧的小增量四舍五入掉，表现为「拖一段完全不动、然后突然跳一大格」——这是实测被指出来的 bug。\n\n3) 精细调整：pointerdown 记录 lastX，并把值直接设为点击位置；pointermove 用**增量** `dx / rect.width * 100 * factor` 更新，`factor = 1/(1 + dist/36)`，`dist = |e.clientY - (rect.top + rect.height/2)|`。贴着滑条是 1:1，36px 外灵敏度减半，108px 外 1/4。绝对位置映射在衰减后会跳变，只能用增量。\n\n4) **不要加「精细调整」之类的文字提示**——它会冒出来挡在百分比下面，反而干扰；精细与否由手感体现，不靠标签。\n\n5) 视觉：手柄默认 8px，`.slider.drag` 时放大到 16px + 4px 品牌色淡光环；`.knob` 加 `pointer-events:none`，避免它成为 pointerdown 的 target 影响拖动判定；`.fill`/`.knob` 过渡只给 0.06 秒。\n\n6) **防止选中文字**：`.slider` 要加 `user-select:none; -webkit-user-select:none; -webkit-user-drag:none`——否则拖动时浏览器会进入文本选择状态，光标变成禁止/工字型，看起来像「拖不动了」。\n\n7) 拖动结束要同时处理 `pointerup` 和 `lostpointercapture`，防止 capture 丢失后 dragging 状态卡住、后续无法再拖。\n\n8) 无障碍：role=\"slider\" + aria-valuemin/max/now + tabindex=\"0\"；方向键 ±1、Home/End 到两端。\n\n9) 配色：轨道 var(--ui-border)；填充/手柄 var(--ui-brand)；数值 var(--ui-text)。\n\n10) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（光标移到手柄 → 按下 → 拖到 85% → 松开 → 停 1 秒）；演示光标逐帧跟随。\n\n11) 使用场景：音量/亮度/播放进度等连续值、滑条较短但需要精调；离散档位用单选；高精度要配输入框。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:22px}\n\n.wrap{width:100%;max-width:300px}\n.head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.head span{font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.head b{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.head b i{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ui-text-dim);margin-left:1px}\n\n.slider{position:relative;height:26px;cursor:pointer;touch-action:none;\n  user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;-webkit-user-drag:none}\n.track{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;height:4px;transform:translateY(-50%);border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-border)}\n.fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;height:4px;transform:translateY(-50%);border-radius:2px;\n  background:linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 62%,transparent),var(--ui-brand));\n  width:65%;transition:width .06s linear}\n.knob{position:absolute;top:50%;left:65%;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-brand);\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:width .15s ease,height .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,left .06s linear;\n  pointer-events:none}\n.slider.drag .knob{width:16px;height:16px;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 16%,transparent)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .wrap{max-width:260px}\n  .head{margin-bottom:7px}\n  .head span{font-size:11px}\n  .head b{font-size:13px}\n  .head b i{font-size:10px}\n  .slider{height:22px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .knob,.fill{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><span>音量</span><b><span id=\"val\">65</span><i>%</i></b></div>\n  <div class=\"slider\" id=\"slider\" role=\"slider\" tabindex=\"0\"\n       aria-label=\"音量\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"65\">\n    <div class=\"track\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></div>\n    <div class=\"knob\" id=\"knob\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var slider = document.getElementById('slider'),\n      fill = document.getElementById('fill'),\n      knob = document.getElementById('knob'),\n      val = document.getElementById('val');\n\n  /* 内部用浮点值，显示时再取整——用整数累加会把小增量吃掉，表现为「拖一段不动、然后突然跳」 */\n  var raw = 65;\n  var dragging = false, rect = null, lastX = 0;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function apply(pct){\n    raw = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, pct));\n    fill.style.width = raw + '%';\n    knob.style.left = raw + '%';\n    val.textContent = String(Math.round(raw));\n    slider.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', Math.round(raw));\n  }\n\n  function onDown(e){\n    rect = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n    dragging = true;\n    slider.classList.add('drag');\n    lastX = e.clientX;\n    apply((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 100);\n    if(slider.setPointerCapture && e.pointerId != null){\n      try { slider.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){}\n    }\n  }\n\n  function onMove(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    /* 垂直距离越远，同样的水平位移带来的变化越小（远距离精细调整） */\n    var centerY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n    var dist = Math.abs(e.clientY - centerY);\n    var factor = 1 / (1 + dist / 36);\n    var dx = e.clientX - lastX;\n    lastX = e.clientX;\n    apply(raw + dx / rect.width * 100 * factor);\n  }\n\n  function onUp(){\n    dragging = false;\n    slider.classList.remove('drag');\n  }\n\n  slider.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n  slider.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n  slider.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n  slider.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n  slider.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', onUp);\n\n  slider.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft'){ apply(raw - 1); e.preventDefault(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowRight'){ apply(raw + 1); e.preventDefault(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'Home'){ apply(0); e.preventDefault(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'End'){ apply(100); e.preventDefault(); }\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    apply(65);\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    rect = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var startX = rect.left + rect.width * 0.65;\n    var startY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n    var endX = rect.left + rect.width * 0.85;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n    c.el.style.left = startX + 'px';\n    c.el.style.top = startY + 'px';\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      slider.setPointerCapture = function(){};\n      onDown({ clientX: startX, clientY: startY });\n\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      var dur = 800;\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 2);\n        var x = startX + (endX - startX) * e;\n        onMove({ clientX: x, clientY: startY });\n        c.el.style.left = x + 'px';\n        c.el.style.top = startY + 'px';\n        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\n        else {\n          c.release();\n          onUp();\n          setTimeout(function(){ if(c.hide) c.hide(); }, 300);\n        }\n      }\n      requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4000); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
